    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "I am glad to get your letter.",
      "path": "audio/1970-110/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.9105439999999998,
      "end": 3.410113
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "The moment of the inward revolution is near but first you have to go through the birth pangs.",
      "path": "audio/1970-110/03.mp3",
      "start": 4.65941,
      "end": 9.903673
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Nothing hurts more than this giving birth to oneself but what comes after it is life's greatest bliss.",
      "path": "audio/1970-110/04.mp3",
      "start": 11.169252,
      "end": 17.571973
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "So, longing, waiting, prayer - take these for your sadhana.",
      "path": "audio/1970-110/05.mp3",
      "start": 18.878118,
      "end": 24.723560000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Everything else is fine.",
      "path": "audio/1970-110/06.mp3",
      "start": 26.310045,
      "end": 28.530998
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
